{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96ef399695d72adb0f09877fd26af0e5b84c075c25c8ecbc6591b9a6b93fbc03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfbab1beb22c4bc1bf5753e34dd8cb220f2b04335e2ae0a7080440cd771add6c",
      "text": "可靠的男人与内心的烦恼",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9045b35daa5257ed35ae8a890251895ab14cde51f1233cdc1909c630b069652",
      "text": "龙接到了男士护肤品的相关工作。因“可靠的男人”这一概念选中自己而感到欣喜的龙拿起了样品，但在看到包装后却大受动摇。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfbab1beb22c4bc1bf5753e34dd8cb220f2b04335e2ae0a7080440cd771add6c",
      "text": "可靠的男人与内心的烦恼",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da41e77cc832ab9bd079d17f3a620e5a63a6c8ed9ef34898a5495415f96a1ae",
      "text": "有工作委托指名龙先生了！\n是一份男士化妆品的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f5e77e6fd89d34b89f0e9fc90dc89c3a18720ae7a0066fb78335e10a8964e8",
      "text": "找我做男士化妆品的工作？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8b7bff74051fa1d6695d510dd2145995af82e455c8f14679fc022118c40b4cc",
      "text": "是的！概念是“可靠的男人也会做的护肤”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e72214ea165dd676bcc852436c8ad141d0331fe59f598997b6d66bb8f93fdc1",
      "text": "说我是可靠的男人，真让人难为情啊！\n能选上我真高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0df9da6e6e7eb9c47a618d67bfeccf6ed7f6f1440b1799c510e12b0e45f2397",
      "text": "护肤啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85fc756f270ae7693759ba4c5330dc6509ace2e05e9c21039a69f592138f06f0",
      "text": "成为偶像之后，虽然会向制作人\n或其他偶像请教，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b5838b1a83a5f8679f51e03f5533b8ddc69a23ecad68a5aaf88a5c5c28d8adc",
      "text": "也做过适当的护理，\n但我从来没注意过具体品牌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e55437398b9f0f8f71a2f9f2f49a047d62b279038e592926f34c790cd70501b",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。既然如此，在工作前试用一下，\n和现在用的对比看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6e57276fe8d4c563879c182acf40fd45e7d8d1cb925fcfd501e2954eef4f43",
      "text": "这是本次工作中要用到的商品样品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b669420a4a2d88228637c4f251338c55e7ddd7e93955876909bdba0e098a21d",
      "text": "嘿——\n……哎！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ea3860b8b9b0af4715d8614a3bfc40faa6d46eea973e6d8c275a7ff50f5df26",
      "text": "这不是老爸在用的生发剂吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d810bce181c18882266517ddc6218416b72cb46b2e32391112a2ade8f605bbf5",
      "text": "（这个包装，不是跟家里那个\n一模一样吗！？为什么会给我生发剂……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c35e73851130371a859b34297cd74eaea2c6d11ee10e0e3da733049292212b5",
      "text": "龙先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a42d946480c726bbe418ed34b2e98fea0a465282b72a622e3fc5f89c034303",
      "text": "难道说是看我的发际线后移了，\n才安排的这项工作……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d13c6602ecaa6afc2f0bda118e61794def4483d7c7d590e1afdbe6559745f3",
      "text": "怎、怎么办啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f0bb88c787431268a1822c91bf2789f6aea5009e35931718e9f210ca0a226c",
      "text": "冷静一点，龙先生！\n这是新上市的爽肤水和乳液哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:722d99f02fdd2e3e22ab90252ce3231b3e4f9b78194a3cb0c5e5d45604f49aad",
      "text": "龙先生的头发很茂密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97847c60df2b78c18696bf90fcbf5f320582b16119092955b42e9f42487cbae8",
      "text": "哎，不是生发剂？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eb54f45785035cdd821bdbc50920d8b2a3ecc0e9da764e47f1ed339e29c18bc",
      "text": "……真的耶。\n仔细看的话确实写着爽肤水。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ffcb26c7762870e15dd88c7b8fda77644e7cf2fcf936c9d24d9a234e70872f3",
      "text": "是的，确实是男士用的护肤品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6078b55544cb308009ef8675195e8f6848b0fbfef25d2de5a7ed836fab2d616c",
      "text": "太、太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ffe177c069248dc8b72bf2cd418d67c491909f7208aae1f660fd5a6b842073",
      "text": "慌里慌张的真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c59e39e53e439f1fb6799062ccd2b897c86243c174d02846f5529ea78805ce0",
      "text": "让您看到丢人的一面了，啊哈哈……\n因为它跟老爸每天用的生发剂太像了，忍不住就。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b955e965a78700e6bd90744d425fa762fa88d17dc71cc550edf3029e9874254",
      "text": "其实我老爸头发比较稀疏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11059bd0295611bcea3e3028ea502008c6f2da4bd67941305fe3d357f419e885",
      "text": "我就很担心自己将来\n会不会也变秃……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b32e8b28abbf20ee22f06aede8eac16ad464f75d804834dbf4cb836aafe7196c",
      "text": "没想到竟然会和家里的生发剂包装撞车，\n真让人意想不到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dcfc3e35c08393bf4aa642cce8934a74a6ff647c32052dd99195e5ff3976d3c",
      "text": "哈哈，我也没想到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5110601bcef85f9154bda1e4aa40afa779f0cb212a922ad79a95c5b3b3aea7c",
      "text": "所以我用梳子梳头的时候也尽量不使劲揉搓，\n稍微注意了一下，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52808ad302125c390a882e69a32bc2cd6b771ec5c885f3ddfe9dca50b9e31c8b",
      "text": "当消防员的时候也尽量注意\n不让头发一直闷着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ba12504673526f60bb2dedb7c76192e2b20e4ac544e2fd237e29297564ae24",
      "text": "您从以前就开始注意护发了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db396ba5ba074b625f07efd352d59e1908b151fbac672a6faa7ce81d26e01fba",
      "text": "因为看到老爸在用，\n我就觉得我也得多注意才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db1fa5c615899befdf806170b40f64ee57aeada1ebe8df01e84d6a19f6e58cb1",
      "text": "虽然这次是爽肤水，但我将来要是也秃了，\n会不会去接拍生发剂的广告啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f01b79b185673822aa3a6265a0cbc563b315e1a24e004926130ba706a9780c41",
      "text": "不管头发变成什么样，龙先生作为偶像的魅力都不会改变的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f6fd30c37125a054620dbb9a44a69725b7a92da5c4778d9446b7cc731d35f50",
      "text": "要真是那样就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ccb301b34b96a2f2bdd7d04548ff6e048288baf4446455586ae5bd3ed15d0a",
      "text": "（虽说头发不会影响作为偶像的魅力，\n但消除龙先生的顾虑也是我工作的一部分！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7e79c0ecc3f636a09d163ad7b66419f2ee136ab1a678767d071ae539791edc",
      "text": "要是我打听到了对头皮有益的信息，\n会立刻告诉龙先生的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31b3aec154d3929c216475857aff23e9f2f2b183e1a770dd651d4aaa838f04aa",
      "text": "为了让龙先生上了年纪也能堂堂正正地站在舞台上，\n我也会全力协助您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bef22b10e6ae766154ffb7fa74f2e4f821173b04e96e5deab4a7e44d11eec76",
      "text": "谢谢你，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062828cef5462c2fd7fc7f8e7368bd0392f810bbe790eaa035f6a5818195273c",
      "text": "是啊，既然这次的概念“可靠的男人”\n选了我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fdb308764b9ba9b54517f817986b3339a8ae429ba8cdd47565a6faa5ef6ad86",
      "text": "而且我的头发看来还挺茂密的，\n可不能总依赖别人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9823db7f65e470506407582599bdf2c3b6701eede6109dc19f8955d6ad7750",
      "text": "好——！多亏了制作人，\n我充满干劲了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7417dd2708bad1a250a76b389351c6544ae5aa3d56ea999d365224fbda9e3dc0",
      "text": "我一定会好好宣传\n这款爽肤水和乳液的魅力与功效的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e695f10e65ab9291380e0e44180001947d216fa6985c2e634e8ca19d0de8f92e",
      "text": "就是这股气势，龙先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:872fe082279eff5af360c6a875c323f892295d41301cf8b02dd01cf21deafb74",
      "text": "头发固然重要，\n但偶像的肌肤也很重要啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc8a6ceda7b229b306f9823d07c297a0ad1dc227271c234813a65dc66e31ea3",
      "text": "毕竟这是要面对许多人的工作，\n不仅是头发，皮肤也得好好保养才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf6be698f108329c5f6a52113930861dabefbc2b727e6a6170f77419bf017fe",
      "text": "好……为了回应客户的期待，\n我一定要把可靠男人的概念演到底！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee805ecb36ffe4b59644a24c26aa9c87225f60ae95fd9cc574d50b5b9d874cf6",
      "text": "好的，龙先生的话绝对能做到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91cc4cb754073d4d9c45f14a38dc0f761e993e7a2c48e4aebe729fd595da1d5c",
      "text": "还有……就算将来我真的秃了，\n我也要做好坦然接受的准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09fc76692710efb148d9bf07e0f37e846967a9d77a8420029aac735a5611bc7b",
      "text": "要是哪天我也变成老爸那样，到那时候生发剂的\n广告也尽管交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
